{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":327886,"duration_api_ms":410728,"num_turns":38,"result":"","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"57200614-8601-4615-b1e6-1a54d2845ec5","total_cost_usd":1.68576405,"usage":{"input_tokens":18,"cache_creation_input_tokens":78060,"cache_read_input_tokens":1178903,"output_tokens":11158,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":78060,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":850,"outputTokens":11420,"cacheReadInputTokens":1230263,"cacheCreationInputTokens":118737,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.32939755,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":18,"outputTokens":11158,"cacheReadInputTokens":1178903,"cacheCreationInputTokens":78060,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":1.3563665,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"structured_output":{"outcome":"request_changes","evidence":["All 8 chloride-nitrite acceptance criteria verified: compute_effective_nitrite_hazard implements the competition formula, chloride_protection_factor is a named species parameter with default 0.5, six unit tests pass (monotonic reduction, zero nitrite, protective ratio, species parameter, stress integration, mortality comparison), integration test models mid-run salt treatment with control branches, tracing and events expose all four diagnostic values.","Invariant validation for chloride_protection_factor added to validate_shrimp_runtime_params (invariants.rs:410-413), with test coverage in both malformed_current_save_with_invalid_molt_mineral_parameters_is_rejected and step_hours_rejects_invalid_molt_mineral_parameters_before_simulation.","Project compiles (cargo check passes, cargo clippy -p tank_core clean). All chloride-related tests pass: shrimp_chloride_protection, shrimp unit tests, tracing diagnostics, events diagnostics, save_load validation, step_hours validation.","REGRESSION: test_closed_system_shrimp_reproduction_conserves_n_and_c fails with BudgetImbalance { element: 'nitrogen', delta_mg: -6.378612511070969e-6, tick_index: 24, day: 1, hour: 0 }. Root cause: uncommitted denitrification in nitrogen_cycle.rs exports N₂ via state.cumulative_n2_export_mg_n (line 570), but nitrogen_budget_components in budget.rs does not include cumulative_n2_export_mg_n, and nitrogen_guard_delta_mg does not subtract the export, so the guard sees unexplained nitrogen loss.","Pre-existing: thermal_reproduction_penalty test fails (base code doesn't compile without the denitrification fixes, so this was already failing)."],"findings_or_gaps":["CRITICAL: Uncommitted denitrification changes in nitrogen_cycle.rs break nitrogen conservation (test_closed_system_shrimp_reproduction_conserves_n_and_c). The nitrogen_budget_components function (budget.rs:229) has 19 components but does not include cumulative_n2_export_mg_n. Fix: either add cumulative_n2_export_mg_n as the 20th budget component so the guard treats it as accounted-for nitrogen, or update nitrogen_guard_delta_mg to subtract denitrification N₂ export as a known open-system flux (analogous to how chemistry_external_carbon_flux_mg handles atmospheric DIC exchange for carbon).","MINOR: Two compiler warnings in nitrogen_cycle.rs — unused import DENITRIFICATION_ALK_MEQ_PER_MG_N (line 5) and unused constant DENITRIFICATION_DOC_MG_C_PER_MG_N (line 18). These are actually used by the denitrification code in the same file, so the warnings may be a stale incremental build artifact, but should be verified with a clean build.","SCOPE: The denitrification implementation (~80 lines of new logic in nitrogen_cycle.rs, update_daily_denitrifier_activity function, engine tracing, tank_scenarios preset defaults) is substantial work beyond the tanksim-6e5.6.5 scope. It was introduced to fix compile blockers mentioned in the prior stage, but should have its own bead for proper review."],"follow_up_or_amendments":["Fix the nitrogen conservation regression by adding cumulative_n2_export_mg_n to nitrogen_budget_components (preferred approach: treat N₂ export as tracked nitrogen so the budget sums to zero). Then re-run cargo test -p tank_core --test budget_tracking to confirm the guard passes.","Clean up the two warnings in nitrogen_cycle.rs. Run cargo check -p tank_core after a cargo clean to confirm they're real or just stale incremental artifacts.","Consider whether the denitrification implementation should be extracted to its own bead for independent review, or if it can ride along with this bead since it fixes the compile blockers."]},"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"e33c2991-bcf9-4c11-b3ed-edd94637b2f3"}
